    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      484.24,
      534.05,
      525.7
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
